                "submission_id": "submission:blindspot-review:1:7177be42",
                "summary": "Blind-spot review of e1f145b..8b0f5e8: privacy, camera stop, way back and layout seams hold. startCapture.shutDown stops every stream track and closes the preview; createCapturePreview.close pauses the video, sets srcObject to null and empties the box; nothing is copied, kept or sent (the canvas holds only drawn points). The controller's stopCamera also closes the preview, which covers a start cancelled before the camera opened. draw() empties .recognise-preview in every state except starting/countdown/recording. The back button sits in the top bar outside the slot, and the overlaid count and canvas have pointer-events:none, so the way back is never blocked. Tests cover all seven ways out plus missing/throwing previews. Layout numbers in docs/recognise.md come from headless Chromium only, not from a device.",
